      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "verso, address",
          "value": "<p>To the glory of my master, the glory of our lord, the head, the \u201cfourth,\u201d Ab\u016b \u2019l-Fa\u1e0dl Evyatar ibn Elijah, the head of the academy. To Fust\u0101t, may God build it.</p>\n<p>Send my best greetings to my master Tsedakah ibn Mukht\u0101r, and notify him that . . . nothing of what he had promised us.</p>\n<p>Counsels of steadfast faithfulness. Counsels of steadfast faithfulness.</p>",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
